# NVIDIA Isaac Lab is its own git checkout (tag v3.0.0-EA), including the Python environment: rebuild it with
# .env_init/readme.txt (the exact package versions are in .env_init/uv.lock)
IsaacLab/
# Isaac Lab 3.0.0 GA as a git worktree of IsaacLab/ with its own environment (lab3.cmd), tried next to EA
IsaacLab-3.0.0/

# runs/: the experiments are kept (batch scripts, settings, genomes, result.json, benchmark results, results.md) so
# they can be re-run; heavy or regenerable output is not
